# The Millennium Calendar: "Whenever you untap one or more permanents during your untap step, put that many time counters on The Millennium
# Calendar." Turn 1: Voltaic Key untaps Mox Pearl in Bot1's main phase, an untap by an effect that counts for nothing, and ends the turn with
# Mox Jet, Mox Ruby and the Key tapped. Bot2's untap step on turn 4 untaps its own tapped Mox Sapphire, which is not Bot1's untap step: no
# counter. Bot1's untap step on turn 3 untaps the three (Calendar and Pearl were untapped): three time counters, one for each, from the one
# trigger (CR 603.2c).

[Bot1 Deck]
The Millennium Calendar
Voltaic Key
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Plains x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.The Millennium Calendar.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Voltaic Key.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Voltaic Key.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Tapped = false
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.The Millennium Calendar.Counters.Time = 3
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Tapped = false
? Bot1.Battlefield.The Millennium Calendar.Counters.Time = 3

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.The Millennium Calendar.Counters.Time = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.The Millennium Calendar.Tapped = false
